Features of Contact Management System
👤 Add Contacts – Add new contacts with details like name, phone number, email, and address.
📋 View Contacts – Display all saved contacts in an organized format.
🔍 Search Contacts – Quickly find contacts using their name, phone number, or email.
✏️ Edit Contacts – Update existing contact information whenever required.
🗑️ Delete Contacts – Remove unwanted or outdated contacts.
📞 Contact Details – Store important information such as phone number, email, and address.
📂 Organize Contacts – Keep all contact information organized in one place.
💾 Data Management – Efficiently store and manage contact records.
📱 Responsive Interface – Easily accessible on different screen sizes.
🔐 Secure Access – Can include user authentication to protect contact information.
⚡ Easy to Use – Simple and user-friendly interface for quick contact management.
🔄 Data Update – Allows users to keep contact information accurate and up to date.


